claims:
1. A method of processing reviews, comprising:
on a server system, including one or more processors, memory storing one or more programs, executed by the one or more processors to perform the method, the server system responding to a search request from a client by:
identifying, in accordance with the search request from the client, a set of reviews from one or more review sources, the set of reviews comprising a plurality of reviews of one or more entities matching the search request;
generating quality scores for respective reviews of the plurality of reviews, the quality score of a respective review based on at least one of the group consisting of: a length of the respective review, lengths of sentences in the respective review, and grammatical quality of the respective review;
selecting a subset of the plurality of reviews based at least on the respective quality scores and predefined quality criteria; and
generating and sending to the client a response to the search request for display at the client, the response including content from the selected subset.

